{"suttaId":"tha-ap290","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8816,8831],"vripara":"33"},"segments":{"tha-ap290:0.3":"Sattāhapabbajitattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap290:1.1":"“Vipassissa bhagavato, saṅgho sakkatamānito;","tha-ap290:1.3":"Byasanaṃ me anuppattaṃ, ñātibhedo pure ahu.","tha-ap290:2.1":"“Pabbajjaṃ upagantvāna, byasanupasamāyahaṃ;","tha-ap290:2.3":"Sattāhābhirato tattha, satthusāsanakamyatā.","tha-ap290:3.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yamahaṃ pabbajiṃ tadā;","tha-ap290:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, pabbajjāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap290:4.1":"“Sattasaṭṭhimhito kappe, satta āsuṃ mahīpatī;","tha-ap290:4.3":"Sunikkhamāti ñāyanti, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap290:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap290:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sattāhapabbajito thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap290:7.1":"Sattāhapabbajitattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
